[{"_1":2},"routes/docs-slug",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8},"content","# AI Model Safety & Trust\n\nTrust is the foundation of Novellis. We provide tools that ensure your intellectual property is protected and that your AI interactions are secure.\n\n## 1. No Training on Your Data\nWhen you connect to established providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google, we utilize their API platforms. \n- **Zero Retention**: We configure our API calls to opt-out of data training by default where the provider allows.\n- **Direct Connection**: Your API keys are stored locally on your machine and are only used for direct communication with the model provider.\n\n## 2. Local Models (Ollama)\nFor absolute certainty, we recommend using **Ollama** or other local inference engines.\n- **completely Air-Gapped**: You can run Novellis and your AI model entirely offline.\n- **No Third-Party Access**: Your lore and drafts never touch any server, including ours.\n\n## 3. Transparency\nNovellis provides a **Heads-Up Display (HUD)** for all AI interactions:\n- **Token Usage**: See exactly how much each request costs.\n- **Context Awareness**: Know exactly which files were sent to the AI for each prompt.\n- **Audit Logs**: Review past AI interactions to see what was discussed and what data was referenced.\n\n## 4. Your IP remains Yours\nThe content generated by AI in Novellis is your property. We do not claim any rights to your manuscripts or world-building notes.\n","slug","safety"]
